    - target: {fileID: 579926175374550239, guid: aa93f41e86e05c345a43e3fe15d6ecc8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "The Dionysus mosaic is the largest and most important, preserved mosaic
        found in excavations in Dion! It shows the epiphany of the triumphant Dionysus.
        In the center of the large mosaic, Dionysus is shown in a chariot. Next to
        him stands Silenus, who is more a helper of the god than a driver. The carriage
        is drawn by two panthers and two centaurs hold their reins. \r\n\r\n \r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
